  "final_output": "**Decision Memo: Weekly Dependency Updates**\n\n**Recommendation:** Move dependency updates from a monthly to a weekly schedule.\n\nWeekly updates will shorten our exposure to known vulnerabilities and allow us to apply security patches sooner. Smaller, more frequent update batches should also make regressions easier to identify and resolve.\n\nThis schedule will add review and testing work each week. However, the smaller scope of each update should keep individual reviews manageable and reduce the risk of large monthly changes.\n\n**Approval needed:** Engineering manager approval to adopt the weekly schedule and allocate the required review capacity.",
